                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-751] The SessionID value returned by the SECC in the SessionSetupRes message shall not change as long as the V2G communication session is not terminated (i.e. value of parameter ChargingSession of SessionStopReq has not been set to \"Terminate\" at any time).",
            "block_bbox": [
