        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2618] If the EVCC sent the SessionSetupReq message with a SessionID consisting only of zeroes and received the SessionSetupRes message with the ResponseCode set to \"OK_NewSessionEstablished\" as well as the SessionID set to a value other than zero, the EVCC shall consider this as a new V2G communication session.",
